{"id":"3fc95f0f8defc51d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-dotted-translation.md","title":"Recursive Dotted-Box Translation","display":"df-dotted-translation — Recursive Dotted-Box Translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-dotted-translation","aliases":["89-df-dotted-translation"],"display":"df-dotted-translation — Recursive Dotted-Box Translation","depends_on":["[[89-df-dotted-box]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-dotted-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-dotted-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dotted-translation — Recursive Dotted-Box Translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nd(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,&amp;d(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nd(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg d(A),&amp;\nd(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq d(A)\\land d(B),\\\\\nd(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box^+d(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nd(p)&amp;\\coloneqq p,&amp;d(\\bot)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nd(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg d(A),&amp;\nd(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq d(A)\\land d(B),\\\\\nd(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\Box^+d(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 12 章，印刷页 155–158；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n唯一映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(d:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。每一层盒都替换为“该层内容成立且可证”，并递归翻译内容；只改最外层盒不构成本翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dotted\\text{-}translation}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nd(p)&\\coloneqq p,&d(\\bot)&\\coloneqq\\bot,\\\\\nd(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\neg d(A),&\nd(A\\land B)&\\coloneqq d(A)\\land d(B),\\\\\nd(\\Box A)&\\coloneqq\\Box^+d(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"d:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false}],"bytes":1059,"backlinks":[{"id":"47cb59806fd7ea7e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"283c19abd035c9ac","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-51","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-translation]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-logic]] → [[89-df-dotted-translation]] → [[89-df-grz-frame]] → [[89-thm-grz-frame-completeness]] → [[89-thm-grz-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["95a48b6ae42f7e48","56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}